  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan asks Lang Ya land spirit for all information on Eighty-Eight True Yang Building in Imperial Court blessed land. The land spirit is shocked that Fang Yuan already knows the Immortal Gu house has something to do with him.",
      "chapters": [
        487
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "loc_wang_ting_blessed_land",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fei Qing tells his son that thick Giant Sun Immortal Venerable bloodline, rare among the Huang Jin family, qualifies one to enter Eighty-Eighth True Yang Building inside Imperial Court blessed land and claim the grace left for later generations.",
      "chapters": [
        488
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "huang-jin-entry",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fei_qing",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ma Ying Jie calls Imperial Court blessed land Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s grace to his descendants, and names Eighty Eight True Yang Building as holding the Immortal Venerable’s inheritance. He claims his own bloodline already meets the criteria to enter, and treats obtaining that inheritance as a path toward becoming a Gu Immortal and raising Ma tribe into a super tribe.",
      "chapters": [
        489
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-venerable-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ma_ying_jie",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_ma_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit asks how Fang Yuan could know a secret from when the Immortal Gu house was refined, when only Giant Sun Immortal Venerable was there as bystander. Fang Yuan recalls that in a prior life Ma Hong Yun entered the building and obtained Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s inheritance. The land spirit pours the requested building information into a rank four east window Gu and hands it to Fang Yuan before the trade is settled, then demands Fang Yuan’s side.",
      "chapters": [
        490
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-secret-and-trade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ma_hong_yun",
        "inh_giant_sun_immortal_venerable_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Giant Sun Immortal Venerable built Eighty-Eight True Yang Building at the sacred palace and set the Imperial Court contest rules before vanishing from the world. The peak of the eighth level stays empty until the ten year blizzard, when the building shows up. When it appears, piercing light at the sacred palace peak clears into a tower on ground that had been barren.",
      "chapters": [
        553
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sacred-palace-peak",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_arc_imperial_court_contest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Every small tower spaced across Imperial Court blessed land is part of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building. Long Hair Ancestor refined that Immortal Gu house to as high as rank eight, and after Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s preparations it mirrors northern plains, with each tower holding thousands of wild Gu that kill those who target them. Even inside the building, the final round of every floor might not grant an Immortal Gu reward.",
      "chapters": [
        556
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "floors-and-small-towers",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_long_hair_ancestor",
        "sys_wild_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eighty-Eight True Yang Building sits at the apex of Gu house examples, with defend, gather, store, and related effects. It is formed from countless small towers, with divert disaster Gu among the main cornerstones, and it sacrifices gathered wild Gu to form power that builds the main body.",
      "chapters": [
        568
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "house-functions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_house",
        "gu_divert_disaster_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside true inheritance secluded domain a supreme true inheritance drives Fang Yuan back with its aura alone, and Mo Yao’s will names the Immortal Gu it contains as the rank nine Gu of legend, wisdom Gu. Fang Yuan asks what methods Giant Sun Immortal Venerable used to seal it there. Of the three supreme true inheritances in the domain, Mo Yao names the other two as a luck path inheritance Giant Sun Immortal Venerable founded and the control rights of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building itself.",
      "chapters": [
        601
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-gu-in-the-supreme-true-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mo_yao",
        "gu_wisdom_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord states that the destruction of Imperial Court blessed land and the collapse of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building were both done by Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        1004
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-names-the-culprit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_heaven_overseeing_tower_lord"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Every ten years its imperial court contest ransacked Northern Plains’ lifespan Gu, and the wisdom Gu it held was slowly fed and recuperated, until Fang Yuan destroyed Imperial Court blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        1074
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-yearly-contest-and-wisdom-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "gu_lifespan_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
